WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:02.980
<b>Day 44</b>

00:07.880 --> 00:11.210
<i>My Search ability has been 
gradually improving,</i>

00:11.210 --> 00:13.640
<i>and at this point, I'm able to 
identify races I've seen before</i>

00:13.640 --> 00:16.750
<i>and get a general idea of their strength.</i>

00:17.650 --> 00:19.380
<i>Something's coming.</i>

00:19.380 --> 00:20.930
G-Gobrou!

00:20.930 --> 00:23.000
I know! I'm coming!

00:27.000 --> 00:28.260
We've been waiting.

00:29.710 --> 00:34.280
You pitiful goblins dare to keep 
noble elves like us waiting.

00:34.280 --> 00:36.270
What is the meaning of this?

00:36.830 --> 00:40.790
<i>I see. I guess these are elves, then.</i>

00:40.790 --> 00:46.020
<i>I've got a gut feeling this 
is gonna be a real pain.</i>

02:21.000 --> 02:23.730
You savages should be grateful.

02:23.730 --> 02:25.000
We're offering you...

02:24.500 --> 02:27.340
<i>He's putting on a very pompous face...</i>

02:27.340 --> 02:31.260
<i>But what it boils down to is that 
humans are about to attack</i>

02:31.260 --> 02:33.260
<i>in an attempt to snatch the elves' treasure,</i>

02:31.260 --> 02:35.440
This isn't extortion. 
You will, of course, be suitably rewarded.

02:33.260 --> 02:37.940
<i>In other words: "We'll pay you
what you're worth, so come help us."</i>

02:36.550 --> 02:39.720
This is couple of months of food 
for the village!

02:39.720 --> 02:41.740
It's a good offer.

02:41.740 --> 02:42.520
Maybe it is.

02:43.750 --> 02:45.140
It's settled, then.

02:45.140 --> 02:47.270
I'll have to refuse!

02:49.270 --> 02:51.440
I couldn't give a rat's ass 
about your situation.

02:51.440 --> 02:55.030
If you want someone's help, 
you need to be sincere about it!

02:55.410 --> 02:56.930
You wretch!

03:09.040 --> 03:10.540
Okay.

03:11.650 --> 03:14.780
If you want to keep your head 
attached to your shoulders,

03:14.780 --> 03:18.550
have your hidden archers lower their bows.

03:22.600 --> 03:25.350
A-All of you, lower your weapons!

03:29.360 --> 03:33.360
I'm turning down your offer 
because I'm not in the mood for it,

03:33.960 --> 03:36.220
but I live in these woods, too.

03:36.690 --> 03:41.370
If humans are headed this way to mess
things up, I'm not against teaming up.

03:43.370 --> 03:44.710
What the?!

03:47.170 --> 03:48.620
<i>Tzenpes.</i>

03:49.460 --> 03:53.520
<i>I don't know how it works, but it seems that 
when I stab something with Kaziklu Bey,</i>

03:53.520 --> 03:55.630
<i>I can produce a limitless amount of spears</i>

03:55.630 --> 03:59.220
<i>that can extend as far out 
as a hundred meters.</i>

04:02.620 --> 04:03.980
Retreat!

04:05.640 --> 04:08.470
What a waste...

04:08.470 --> 04:11.350
<i>They won't be back for a while 
after a scare like that.</i>

04:11.350 --> 04:13.150
<i>...At least, I hope.</i>

04:13.650 --> 04:16.150
<b>Day 45</b>

04:16.540 --> 04:20.660
<i>The next day, I hunted 
gray slimes deep in the woods</i>

04:27.790 --> 04:30.880
<i>About twenty of them.</i>

04:32.250 --> 04:36.130
<i>The abilities I got 
from eating their cores...</i>

04:36.380 --> 04:38.340
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Physical Attack Resistance]</b>

04:37.290 --> 04:42.340
<i>Physical Attack Resistance. 
Auto Replication. Fluid Regeneration.</i>

04:38.340 --> 04:40.380
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Auto Replication]</b>

04:40.380 --> 04:42.340
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Fluid Regeneration]</b>

04:51.470 --> 04:52.860
I see...

04:53.820 --> 04:56.310
So this is Auto Replication?

04:58.280 --> 04:59.860
I can see myself!

05:00.290 --> 05:03.140
It looks like we've got linked senses.

05:04.190 --> 05:06.120
I just had a great idea.

05:06.620 --> 05:09.120
<b>Day 46</b>

05:10.000 --> 05:14.140
<i>I had Gobmi and the others 
whip up some traveling clothes</i>

05:14.140 --> 05:16.390
<i>that have my blood in the lining.</i>

05:17.130 --> 05:22.130
<i>It'll serve as a transmitter 
in case of an emergency.</i>

05:22.630 --> 05:25.140
<b>Day 47</b>

05:29.140 --> 05:32.140
My bad feeling turned out to be right.

05:32.140 --> 05:35.650
Here they come again, 
having not learned a damn thing.

05:38.150 --> 05:40.280
Alright, all of you...

05:50.320 --> 05:53.540
I can't move! What's happening?!

06:11.660 --> 06:14.350
Now, what are you doing back here?

06:14.350 --> 06:18.260
Y-Your barbarism the other day 
has wounded my pride!

06:18.260 --> 06:22.110
Y-Your lack of respect h-has 
earned you more than one death!

06:22.610 --> 06:24.010
We're sorry.

06:24.010 --> 06:27.870
We tried to stop him, but he wouldn't listen.

06:30.020 --> 06:34.370
Here's what we're gonna do. 
First, consider this idiot boss of yours dead.

06:34.910 --> 06:40.380
The rest of you will face my people in 
mock battles. Anyone who wins gets to live.

06:40.730 --> 06:44.130
If you elves want to live, 
then fight and win!

06:46.390 --> 06:53.070
<i>To skip to the end of the story, out of 
the 23 elves who fought, six were defeated.</i>

06:53.070 --> 06:56.400
<i>The six who lost were all men, incidentally.</i>

06:57.130 --> 07:02.700
<i>Nobody tell them I tweaked the match-ups 
because I didn't like the idea of dead beauties.</i>

07:03.110 --> 07:06.370
Now that was a meal!

07:03.880 --> 07:05.440
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Resident of Evergreen]</b>

07:03.880 --> 07:06.670
<i>Resident of Evergreen. Elementaler.</i>

07:05.440 --> 07:06.650
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Elementaler]</b>

07:06.650 --> 07:07.860
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Knowledge of Archery]</b>

07:06.670 --> 07:10.370
<i>Knowledge of Archery. Tracking. Hiding.</i>

07:07.860 --> 07:09.280
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Tracking]</b>

07:09.280 --> 07:10.830
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Hiding]</b>

07:10.870 --> 07:15.060
Alright, those of you won need to 
surrender your weapons and magic items.

07:15.060 --> 07:16.620
You're prisoners now.

07:16.620 --> 07:19.800
What?! I thought you 
would let us go if we won!

07:20.380 --> 07:24.150
Seriously? You came here to kill us.

07:24.150 --> 07:27.130
Did you think you were 
gonna get off that lightly?

07:29.180 --> 07:33.270
Elves have so many babes! 
Tonight is gonna be fun!

07:35.700 --> 07:38.070
No touching without permission, got it?!

07:39.270 --> 07:43.280
I mean, you're the boss in the village...

07:44.280 --> 07:50.660
I'll do as you say. Gotta set a
 good example for the young'uns.

07:51.300 --> 07:52.630
Gobjii...

07:54.660 --> 07:57.550
Could I get at least 
a little action, though?

07:57.550 --> 08:00.060
I'm so pent up, I'm about to burst.

08:01.140 --> 08:03.050
All things in moderation.

08:03.050 --> 08:06.300
Now, if you were wondering 
how I was gonna execute you...

08:06.660 --> 08:08.530
D-Don't do it!

08:08.530 --> 08:11.720
Don't... p-please stop!

08:11.720 --> 08:13.140
I'm begging you!

08:15.810 --> 08:18.310
<b>Day 48</b>

08:26.780 --> 08:29.150
<b>[Gobkichi]</b>

08:29.660 --> 08:32.160
<b>Day 49</b>

08:32.440 --> 08:34.270
H-Hey, is that...

08:34.270 --> 08:35.410
No way...

08:35.860 --> 08:37.910
But his face...

08:43.920 --> 08:46.320
Are you... Is that...

08:46.320 --> 08:47.670
Gobkichi!

08:48.340 --> 08:50.680
Wow, you look like a different goblin!

08:50.680 --> 08:55.430
What the hell, man? If you had 
ranked up, you could've just told me!

08:56.280 --> 09:00.440
<i>Gobkichi apparently has evolved 
into a special variant.</i>

09:00.840 --> 09:04.900
<i>The dark red skin is the result of a 
blessing from the Demigod of Flame.</i>

09:04.900 --> 09:12.450
<i>And the glossy, iron-hard skin he has is 
supposedly a blessing from the Demigod of War.</i>

09:12.760 --> 09:18.290
Gobrou, since you became an ogre, 
you haven't had anyone to spar with...

09:18.290 --> 09:21.210
and I was worried I couldn't catch up to you.

09:21.210 --> 09:23.710
But now I can say this:

09:24.610 --> 09:26.960
I want you to fight me again!

09:26.960 --> 09:29.720
All right. Let's do it!

09:37.590 --> 09:39.220
Not bad, Gobkichi!

09:39.220 --> 09:41.230
I'm not done yet!

09:50.490 --> 09:56.130
<i>I still had the edge in combat skills, 
which let me come out on top.</i>

09:56.490 --> 09:59.010
<i>But this proved something to me...</i>

09:59.010 --> 10:02.670
<i>Gobkichi really is my rival!</i>

10:03.610 --> 10:07.750
<i>It was that night, when I was exhausted 
from some serious sparring.</i>

10:08.920 --> 10:11.760
Forgive me. I must apologize.

10:11.760 --> 10:14.920
<i>That's not Gobjii... so who is it?</i>

10:15.620 --> 10:20.010
Please. This gift is the least 
I can provide you.

10:20.020 --> 10:24.020
<b>Gobrou obtained [Kin of ■■■]</b>

10:27.380 --> 10:30.330
What was that, just now?

10:31.530 --> 10:34.030
<b>Day 51</b>

10:34.030 --> 10:37.670
Seriously, what is this big deal, Gobe?

10:37.670 --> 10:39.160
You gotta see it, trust me!

10:39.930 --> 10:42.210
<i>I think Gobkichi might've 
been good inspiration,</i>

10:42.210 --> 10:44.410
<i>because we've got four new hobgoblins.</i>

10:45.160 --> 10:49.400
You're late. I've already 
tested them for aptitude.

10:49.400 --> 10:51.830
One of them has the
potential to be a Mage...

10:51.830 --> 10:52.920
And another...

10:53.490 --> 10:56.380
This one is suited to being a Cleric.

10:57.680 --> 10:59.900
H-Hello there. I'm Gobji.

10:59.900 --> 11:05.110
I'll do my best to heal as many people 
as possible, big brother Gobrou.

11:05.770 --> 11:09.690
Big brother? Something 
about that sounds funny...

11:09.690 --> 11:14.250
Well, we've all been siblings 
from the day we were born, after all.

11:14.920 --> 11:19.870
So, Hobsei, are you ever going to 
explain what happened with you?

11:20.200 --> 11:23.000
I was simply waiting for you to bring it up.

11:23.610 --> 11:27.640
<i>Hobsei said she had evolved 
when she woke up in the morning.</i>

11:28.360 --> 11:33.660
<i>She's apparently grown into the
 lord family as a half-spell lord.</i>

11:34.210 --> 11:39.050
However, lords usually don't 
have makings like these...

11:41.050 --> 11:43.970
<i>They look like the ones on my body.</i>

11:44.560 --> 11:47.230
What are you just standing 
around for, Gobrou?

11:47.850 --> 11:50.080
I'm overflowing with mana at the moment.

11:50.630 --> 11:54.990
Let's go and see just how much 
more powerful I am now.

12:12.570 --> 12:14.640
And I've still got plenty more 
where that came from.

12:14.640 --> 12:18.040
I think I could cast that one 
another 20 times.

12:18.040 --> 12:20.140
Actually, let me just show you!

12:20.140 --> 12:24.140
Uh, no, I'm convinced already! 
Thank you so much.

12:24.790 --> 12:27.270
<i>When you've got a half 
in front of your race name,</i>

12:27.270 --> 12:30.340
<i>you're not quite as powerful 
as you would be otherwise.</i>

12:30.670 --> 12:35.750
<i>In the case of Hobsei, she's likely to evolve 
all the way into a spell lord next time.</i>

12:36.150 --> 12:40.060
That being the case, here's some new 
equipment to celebrate your rank-up!

12:40.940 --> 12:43.750
I'm jealous! You left me behind.

12:43.750 --> 12:46.040
I'm sure you'll catch up soon, Sato.

12:46.880 --> 12:48.500
Thanks.

12:48.500 --> 12:53.250
<i>Evolutions in this village seem to be 
happening rather frequently...</i>

12:53.260 --> 12:56.550
<i>I'm pretty sure that's because of me.</i>

12:57.040 --> 12:58.800
<i>I'm speculating at this point,</i>

12:59.350 --> 13:03.010
<i>but I think the environment 
in the first month of a goblin's life</i>

13:03.010 --> 13:05.950
<i>can have a major effect 
on their rate of growth.</i>

13:06.790 --> 13:10.640
<i>In any case, having our people 
get stronger is a good thing.</i>

13:11.300 --> 13:15.570
<i>But there are those who weren't so lucky...</i>

13:16.070 --> 13:18.570
<b>Day 52</b>

13:19.480 --> 13:22.320
We're going to be eating good tonight.

13:26.730 --> 13:29.330
Where are you guys headed at this hour?

13:29.570 --> 13:31.580
W-We can't do this anymore!

13:32.600 --> 13:35.240
We've been trying to hang in there, 
hoping to turn things around,

13:35.240 --> 13:37.560
but the youngsters 
are all leaving us behind!

13:37.560 --> 13:39.690
We haven't even been able to get any action.

13:40.110 --> 13:42.840
So we're leaving the village!

13:43.640 --> 13:45.600
G-Go ahead and kill us if you want.

13:46.000 --> 13:49.100
But we've had enough of living like this!

13:49.490 --> 13:51.850
Okay, understood. Take care of yourselves!

13:52.800 --> 13:54.100
You're not gonna stop us?

13:54.440 --> 13:58.730
That looks like your own gear, 
so why would I?

13:59.500 --> 14:03.860
But if you're going, I dunno, take this 
as a last offering, or maybe a parting gift.

14:04.920 --> 14:08.160
This knife is made with a
 magical metal called mythril.

14:08.160 --> 14:09.870
It's got a really good edge.

14:14.820 --> 14:15.990
Let's go.

14:16.400 --> 14:17.610
Dammit.

14:18.750 --> 14:21.260
<b>Day 53</b>

14:22.020 --> 14:24.460
<i>We were searching the woods</i>

14:24.460 --> 14:27.290
<i>when we discovered a human 
who had been killed by an orc.</i>

14:28.290 --> 14:30.770
<i>He was already out of luck...</i>

14:34.520 --> 14:37.510
<i>But he seems to have had 
an interesting ability.</i>

14:37.510 --> 14:41.780
<i>Being able to use it well might be 
a way of paying him some respect.</i>

14:42.030 --> 14:45.280
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Monster Tamer]</b>

14:43.060 --> 14:44.730
<i>Monster Tamer.</i>

14:45.850 --> 14:47.490
<i>And that night...</i>

14:48.830 --> 14:50.890
Now, don't be too shocked...

14:50.890 --> 14:55.080
I've finally produced something 
you've been wanting for a long time.

14:55.900 --> 14:57.580
Is that what I think it is?!

14:58.730 --> 15:00.170
It's booze!

15:01.380 --> 15:03.740
Thank you! Thank you so much!

15:04.590 --> 15:07.090
<b>Day 54</b>

15:08.300 --> 15:09.600
That being the case...

15:10.110 --> 15:13.680
The goblins from the generation 
before ours have left the village.

15:14.560 --> 15:18.100
If anyone wants to join them, 
raise your hand.

15:18.100 --> 15:22.360
I won't stop you, 
and I'll provide parting gifts, too.

15:25.700 --> 15:26.900
All right.

15:27.480 --> 15:30.870
Forget I mentioned it then! 
Now, let's have a toast!

15:31.370 --> 15:33.870
<b>Day 55</b>

15:33.870 --> 15:37.620
<i>Things were peaceful for the next few days.</i>

15:38.670 --> 15:43.170
<i>I worked on producing earrings 
with my own blood in them.</i>

15:43.590 --> 15:46.290
<i>They would act as communications devices.</i>

15:47.760 --> 15:50.260
<b>Day 56</b>

15:51.950 --> 15:55.300
<i>We've got cloudy weather today, 
I repeat, cloudy weather.</i>

15:55.300 --> 15:58.020
Wow! I really can hear you!

15:58.020 --> 16:02.760
<i>After testing, I got to work 
making enough for all of us.</i>

16:03.530 --> 16:06.030
<b>Day 57</b>

16:10.910 --> 16:12.300
Nice, Gobe!

16:12.300 --> 16:15.950
<i>It was great seeing how much 
stronger Gobe had gotten,</i>

16:15.950 --> 16:19.920
<i>but after seeing the tri-horn horse she 
had brought in was basically unharmed,</i>

16:19.920 --> 16:22.290
<i>I had an idea.</i>

16:22.760 --> 16:27.800
<i>It was time to test the ability I got 
from that human: Monster Tamer.</i>

16:30.760 --> 16:34.690
This should work perfectly 
as our first familiar!

16:39.190 --> 16:41.690
<b>Day 58</b>

16:45.020 --> 16:47.240
<i>Like the tri-horn horse,</i>

16:47.240 --> 16:50.700
<i>a gray bear proved to be 
a really useful familiar.</i>

16:51.930 --> 16:55.700
<i>The head of the black wolf 
pack became my pet</i>

16:55.700 --> 16:59.960
<i>and serves as a bodyguard 
for the human girls.</i>

17:00.460 --> 17:02.960
<b>Day 59</b>

17:03.540 --> 17:07.710
<i>I experienced a real shock on the 59th day...</i>

17:10.920 --> 17:12.780
<i>The short-haired redhead,</i>

17:12.780 --> 17:16.720
<i>who as a rookie warrior had 
never really come into her own...</i>

17:23.190 --> 17:27.110
<i>really seems to grow when she's on the ropes.</i>

17:31.480 --> 17:35.160
<i>Even if I had to arrange for
 her to fight one-on-one,</i>

17:35.160 --> 17:38.120
<i>she was able to beat three kobolds.</i>

17:41.030 --> 17:43.240
Can I have some of that, too?

17:43.630 --> 17:47.850
Sure. It's not poisonous, 
so it should be fine.

17:50.620 --> 17:51.650
What is it?

17:52.020 --> 17:54.890
Well... I think...

17:56.650 --> 17:59.920
I just got a new job.

18:11.400 --> 18:16.160
Look, Gobrou! I can even hunt like this now!

18:16.670 --> 18:20.190
<i>Her new job is Noir Soldat.</i>

18:20.190 --> 18:23.480
<i>She needs to periodically 
eat monsters or she'll die.</i>

18:23.480 --> 18:27.170
<i>But it results in some 
astonishing growth.</i>

18:27.170 --> 18:31.630
A few goblins were attacked by humans
 and had to run home again today.

18:31.630 --> 18:34.730
I see. It's nearly time, then...

18:34.730 --> 18:36.680
Time for what?

18:37.030 --> 18:39.680
The war between humans and elves.

18:40.180 --> 18:42.680
<b>Day 60</b>

18:45.260 --> 18:48.790
<i>Kobolds are fleeing, being chased by...</i>

18:49.960 --> 18:53.700
<i>It's too dark. I can't identify them, 
even with Search.</i>

18:54.390 --> 18:57.240
We'll figure something out with
 the kobolds once they're in here.

18:57.240 --> 18:58.700
Leave them be for now!

19:00.700 --> 19:02.950
And behind them...

19:07.160 --> 19:09.460
Magically-animated skeletons, huh?

19:09.830 --> 19:12.460
Gobmi! Shoot them down!

19:12.460 --> 19:13.600
Got it!

19:15.260 --> 19:16.630
No good! It's not working!

19:19.800 --> 19:21.640
There are too many!

19:21.950 --> 19:24.230
This is gonna get bad, Gobrou!

19:25.220 --> 19:30.150
<i>There's one big signal behind the
 ever-increasing horde of skeletons.</i>

19:30.600 --> 19:34.650
<i>Most likely the one creating them...</i>

19:35.150 --> 19:36.240
Here they come!

19:40.580 --> 19:42.280
There are so many...

19:42.770 --> 19:43.810
Take that!

19:47.780 --> 19:49.320
That settles it!

19:49.320 --> 19:52.420
Everybody, weapons down! 
Don't try to cut them...

19:53.300 --> 19:55.710
Smash them apart!

19:56.280 --> 19:57.430
Right!

20:02.960 --> 20:04.970
This'll be a nice chance 
to earn some experience!

20:05.440 --> 20:08.730
Keep smashing skeletons 
for as long as you can!

20:08.730 --> 20:10.730
But then what?

20:11.360 --> 20:12.950
Leave that to me!

20:14.210 --> 20:16.780
Time to wrap this up. Everyone, get clear.

20:17.480 --> 20:19.280
This should take about ten seconds.

20:21.030 --> 20:21.780
One...

20:22.810 --> 20:23.710
Two...

20:24.940 --> 20:25.930
Three...

20:27.040 --> 20:28.290
Four...

20:28.920 --> 20:30.040
Five...

20:31.300 --> 20:32.170
Six...

20:34.100 --> 20:35.170
Seven...

20:38.610 --> 20:42.390
Huh. Guess I finished 
three seconds early.

20:45.100 --> 20:46.180
Quit that.

20:47.930 --> 20:50.720
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Summon Lower Undead]</b>

20:47.940 --> 20:51.390
<i>Summon Lower Undead. 
High-Tier Equipment Materialization.</i>

20:50.720 --> 20:52.230
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [High-Tier Equipment Materialization]</b>

20:51.390 --> 20:54.890
<i>Mana Absorption. Low Damage Reduction.</i>

20:52.230 --> 20:53.810
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Mana Absorption]</b>

20:53.810 --> 20:55.310
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Low Damage Reduction]</b>

20:54.890 --> 20:57.070
<i>Low Magic Reduction.</i>

20:55.310 --> 20:57.070
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Low Magic Reduction]</b>

20:57.480 --> 20:59.070
My lord!

20:59.850 --> 21:02.020
What... What is this?

21:02.960 --> 21:07.160
<i>The kobolds accidentally dug 
their way into Velvet's treasury,</i>

21:07.160 --> 21:09.330
<i>which we had visited earlier.</i>

21:09.880 --> 21:14.840
<i>And that awakened its guardian, 
a greater skeleton.</i>

21:15.430 --> 21:18.410
<i>To escape the swarm of skeletons,</i>

21:18.410 --> 21:24.350
<i>they made a last-ditch run for the
 cave of the terrifying black ogre...</i>

21:24.790 --> 21:30.410
This "lord" thing... you realize 
we've killed plenty of your kind, right?

21:30.900 --> 21:34.980
We're fully aware! The strong 
devouring the weak is natural law!

21:34.980 --> 21:40.240
Yet our survival here, in this 
moment, is at your discretion!

21:40.240 --> 21:43.680
Okay, fine! Let's get your wounded looked at.

21:43.680 --> 21:45.290
We can talk more after.

21:45.290 --> 21:46.240
Yes, sir!

21:49.250 --> 21:52.380
<i>I have no idea how this happened...</i>

21:52.380 --> 21:56.250
<i>But I've gathered quite an interesting crowd.</i>

23:30.010 --> 23:40.020
<b>Next Time:</b>
